<div class="about-page native-app">
  <header class="topbar ui-material native-chrome">
    <%= erb :_municipality_selector, layout: false %>
    <nav class="topbar__nav" aria-label="Site">
      <%= erb :_account_navigation, layout: false %>
      <span class="topbar__link is-current">About</span>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="about-page__body">
    <section class="about-page__content ui-panel" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <p class="about-page__eyebrow">About Muni</p>
      <h1 id="about-title">Municipal information for every human.</h1>
      <p>
        MUNI stands for <strong>Municipal Unified Network of Information</strong>.
        We bring public records, maps, meetings, and local services together so
        anyone can find, understand, and use the information that shapes daily life.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our mission is to make municipal information accessible to all humans&mdash;not
        only government staff, data specialists, or people who already know where
        to look. Understanding the place you live should not require insider knowledge.
      </p>
      <p>
        Muni.fyi is an independent civic project. We believe
        better access to local information helps people participate in, care for,
        and improve the places they call home.
      </p>
      <p class="about-page__note">
        Muni.fyi is evolving. Information may be incomplete, delayed, or inaccurate.
        If you spot something that needs correction, email
        <a href="mailto:hello@muni.fyi">hello@muni.fyi</a>. Your report helps
        us correct the record and improve our data pipelines.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</div>
